WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:02.907
Unit one. Growing and Changing!

2
00:00:03.919 --> 00:00:07.588
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.638 --> 00:00:10.524
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.574 --> 00:00:14.066
Today we learn about Growing and Changing. Let's go!

5
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.187
Puberty. Say it with me. Puberty!

6
00:00:21.734 --> 00:00:24.800
Growth. Say it with me. Growth!

7
00:00:28.287 --> 00:00:31.471
Hygiene. Say it with me. Hygiene!

8
00:00:34.961 --> 00:00:39.161
Emotional change. Say it with me. Emotional change!

9
00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:46.283
Development. Say it with me. Development!

10
00:00:49.784 --> 00:00:53.418
Body change. Say it with me. Body change!

11
00:00:56.873 --> 00:01:00.540
Self-care. Say it with me. Self-care!

12
00:01:04.035 --> 00:01:07.802
Adolescence. Say it with me. Adolescence!

13
00:01:11.372 --> 00:01:22.524
During adolescence, my body goes through puberty and many physical changes. Good hygiene and self-care become more important during this stage of growth and development. It is normal to notice emotional change too.

14
00:01:22.574 --> 00:01:25.246
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:26.737 --> 00:01:31.641
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:32.841
Hygiene!

17
00:01:33.681 --> 00:01:38.839
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.889 --> 00:01:40.039
Self-care!

19
00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:47.887
Did you know? Every person goes through puberty at their own pace - there is no single 'right' age for every change to happen.

20
00:01:47.937 --> 00:01:49.674
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:59.030
Think and answer. Why is self-care especially important during adolescence?

22
00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:00.230
Great answer!

23
00:02:01.315 --> 00:02:05.639
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.689 --> 00:02:08.223
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

